KofMut uses the official Kof compiler frontend as an external JVM library.
Kof's compiler is licensed under GNU GPLv3. The compiler jar is resolved
from the user's installed Kof distribution and is not included here.
Retain the notices supplied with that distribution.

The official Kof distribution supplies an embedded Eclipse Temurin JDK
under GPLv2 with the Classpath Exception. KofMut uses that installation
without copying or redistributing the JDK.
